<title>UK: Manchester United up after Euro cup victory.</title>
<headline>Manchester United up after Euro cup victory.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Manchester United Plc rose on Thursday after the English premier league leaders won a convincing victory in last night's European Cup game against FC Porto.</p>
<p>The stock, which has in recent sessions drifted off its record 737p set in January, was up 17-1/2p at 665 by 1015 GMT.</p>
<p>Manchester's four-nil victory left the club well placed to secure a place in the semi-finals of the lucrative European championship.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
